<title>USA: Utah Medical Products Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>Utah Medical Products Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third Quarter ended September 30:</p>
<p>			  Percent Change	   1996	    1995</p>
<p>Net Sales			 (6.7%)   $9,993,639   $10,715,736</p>
<p>Gross Profit		    (0.5%)    4,989,655     5,015,850</p>
<p>Operating Income		 3.8%    3,152,346     3,037,832</p>
<p>Income Before Tax		3.0%    3,422,498     3,323,536</p>
<p>Net Income			 1.4%    2,190,399     2,160,299</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share	    12.1%	   .240	    .214</p>
<p>Shares Outstanding (fully diluted)    9,125,737    10,093,855</p>
<p>Nine Months ended September 30:</p>
<p>			  Percent Change	   1996	    1995</p>
<p>Net Sales			 (3.6%)  $30,050,405   $31,181,752</p>
<p>Gross Profit			1.4%   14,589,940    14,392,232</p>
<p>Operating Income		  6.2%    9,045,037     8,513,778</p>
<p>Income Before Tax		14.1%   10,659,181     9,340,366</p>
<p>Net Income			 12.7%    6,844,790     6,071,240</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share	     19.3%	   .714	    .599</p>
<p>Shares Outstanding (fully diluted)    9,582,758    10,143,691</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Utah Medical Products Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
